[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0010","text":"关于下周封面拍摄的事……\n全员拍摄结束后，\n还会有单人拍摄──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0020","text":"嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0030","text":"（全员拍摄结束后……单人拍摄……）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0040","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0050","text":"怎么回事……？\n停电了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0060","text":"──看来是的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0070","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0080","text":"其他房间是不是也停电了呢……\n我去确认一下"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0090","text":"啊，凛世就在那里别动"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200400_01_0100","text":"是、是的……"}]
